  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Mix 60 ml olive oil, 3 tbsp lemon juice, 4 garlic cloves, grated, 2 tbsp plain yogurt, 2 tsp ground cumin, 2 tsp ground coriander, 2 tsp paprika, 1 tsp ground turmeric, 1/2 tsp ground cinnamon, 1/2 tsp ground allspice, 1/4 tsp ground cardamom, 1/4 tsp cayenne pepper, 1 1/2 tsp salt and 1/2 tsp black pepper. Toss with 1.2 kg boneless skinless chicken thighs and refrigerate at least 2 hours, or overnight.",
